  "details": "Currently the only way to make your personal mirror visible to the in game camera is to enable the UI Mask option. \n\nThis presents several challenges for content creators. If you wanted to use your personal mirror for an additional effect then it also means showing the physical camera UI, speech to text bubbles, controller holograms, personal menus, and everything else UI related. \n\nI would like to see the personal mirror separated into its own mask. So you can make only the mirror visible to the camera while still hiding the rest of the UI.",
